---
// The logo's braces, opened and closed around a home section: «{» in the left edge, «}» in the
// right one, as tall as the section. Each brace is two halves (hook + line, then the point), drawn
// with CSS borders so they stretch without bending the curves and take the theme's colour.
// Decorative: hidden from assistive tech, hidden on phones.
---

{['brace-open', 'brace-close'].map((side) => (
  <span class:list={['brace', side]} aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="brace-half"></span><span class="brace-half"></span>
  </span>
))}
